	<section_number>2.2-401</section_number>
	<catch_line>Ex officio Secretary to Governor; in charge of division of records</catch_line>
	<text>
		The Secretary of the Commonwealth, who shall be ex officio Secretary to the Governor, shall be in direct charge of the division of records.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 2-58; 1966, c. 677, § 2.1-66; 2001, c. 844.</history>
